&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:6pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:6pt;"&gt;＜クレーム件数＞&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:6pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:6pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:6pt;"&gt;・クレーム件数 26％改善（2020年度比）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:6pt;"&gt;製造難易度の高い大型製品の販売比率が増加したものの、製造工程に起因するクレームは減少&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:6pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:6pt;"&gt;＜重大有責事故＞&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:6pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;font-size:6pt;"&gt;・鉄道・船舶輸送の重大有責事故ゼロを継続&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
